OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police sent out over fake
OL,4,AHalloween weapon
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police were called after a woman
OL,7,Fwas seen carrying a weapon which turned
OL,8,Fout to be a Halloween prop.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police was called to
OL,11,FBicester Road in Aylesbury,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, at about 13:15 BST
OL,13,Fyesterday following the report.
OL,15,FIt found the woman at nearby Friars
OL,16,FSquare Shopping Centre with plastic
OL,17,FHalloween-style accessories.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
