OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police sent out over fake
OL,4,AHalloween weapon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said: "In the lead up to
OL,7,FHalloween, we would like to remind the
OL,8,Fpublic to be mindful when going outside
OL,9,Fwith Halloween accessories that imitate
OL,10,For look like weapons."
